TCNT0H|IO8|0x14
TCCR0A|IO8|0x15
PINB|IO8|0x16
DDRB|IO8|0x17
PORTB|IO8|0x18
PINA|IO8|0x19
DDRA|IO8|0x1A
PORTA|IO8|0x1B
EECR|IO8|0x1C
EEDR|IO8|0x1D
EEARL|IO8|0x1E
EEARH|IO8|0x1F
